@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# audio_spawn.dem — v2-sound-immediacy's spawn-chime golden (the audio golden
+# family's third member, T1-only like audio_throttle.dem): the event→sound map
+# gains EVENT_TAG_NODE_SPAWNED (the growth reveal chime — the spawn-feel
+# telegraph announces, this chime confirms). The consumer mirror must draw at
+# least one spawn variant (the vacuous guard) — and the recipe's draws at
+# 2000/2500 ms (the 1000 ms entry is a ROUTER PLACE, not a draw) also fire
+# EVENT_TAG_PIPE_DRAWN, so the wire-placed click is proven in a growth
+# context too.
+#
+# The recipe is growth.dem's proven era-1 setup, shortened to 30 s (T1-only,
+# no captures): the fixture router mesh seeds the growth director, the
+# player's placed router at 1000 ms extends the mesh, and the two draws at
+# 2000/2500 ms wire the new houses in (connectable-by-construction). Growth
+# spawns one terminal per 80-tick window (4 s at 20 Hz — the pace-tuning
+# cadence), so the run fires ~7 NODE_SPAWNED events. Determinism: growth is
+# seed-derived run setup — replay re-derives the identical spawn ticks, so
+# the T1 + replay gate pin the spawn events exactly like any other sim event.
+seed 42
+era 1
+run 30000ms
+growth on
+at 1000ms place router_basic 34 15
+at 2000ms draw 1 3 standard
+at 2500ms draw 0 1 standard
